{"seq":2,"slug":"retirement-accounts","title":"养老金账户体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/personal-finance/retirement-planning/retirement-accounts","wordCount":1415,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"养老金账户体系\">养老金账户体系</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>养老金账户体系是退休规划的基础设施。中国的养老保障体系由三大支柱构成：第一支柱是国家基本养老保险（强制缴纳）、第二支柱是企业年金/职业年金（企业可选）、第三支柱是个人养老金（个人自愿）。对程序员而言，单靠基本养老保险的退休金远不足以维持当前的生活水平，必须通过第二、第三支柱和个人投资来补足缺口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[中国养老保障三支柱] --&gt; B[第一支柱]&#10;    A --&gt; C[第二支柱]&#10;    A --&gt; D[第三支柱]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[基本养老保险]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2[强制缴纳]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B3[替代率约40-50%]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[企业年金]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[企业自愿建立]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C3[覆盖率约10%]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[个人养老金]&#10;    D1 --&gt; D2[年缴费上限12000元]&#10;    D1 --&gt; D3[税收递延优惠]\">flowchart TD\n    A[中国养老保障三支柱] --&gt; B[第一支柱]\n    A --&gt; C[第二支柱]\n    A --&gt; D[第三支柱]\n    B --&gt; B1[基本养老保险]\n    B1 --&gt; B2[强制缴纳]\n    B1 --&gt; B3[替代率约40-50%]\n    C --&gt; C1[企业年金]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[企业自愿建立]\n    C1 --&gt; C3[覆盖率约10%]\n    D --&gt; D1[个人养老金]\n    D1 --&gt; D2[年缴费上限12000元]\n    D1 --&gt; D3[税收递延优惠]</pre><p>三大支柱的核心参数对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>第一支柱(基本养老)</th>\n<th>第二支柱(企业年金)</th>\n<th>第三支柱(个人养老金)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缴费主体</td>\n<td>个人+企业(强制)</td>\n<td>企业+个人(自愿)</td>\n<td>个人(自愿)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个人缴费比例</td>\n<td>工资的 8%</td>\n<td>工资的 1-8%</td>\n<td>每年 ≤12000 元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业缴费比例</td>\n<td>工资的 16%</td>\n<td>工资的 1-8%</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税收优惠</td>\n<td>缴费税前扣除</td>\n<td>EET模式(缴费免税)</td>\n<td>缴费可税前扣除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资选择</td>\n<td>无(统筹管理)</td>\n<td>有限选择</td>\n<td>较多选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领取条件</td>\n<td>法定退休年龄</td>\n<td>退休/出国/病残</td>\n<td>退休/出国/病残</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖率</td>\n<td>~95%</td>\n<td>~10%(多为国企/大企业)</td>\n<td>开通人数逐步增长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>程序员群体中，大部分人在互联网公司工作，基本养老保险是标配，但企业年金的覆盖率极低。这意味着<strong>退休规划的主要责任在个人</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基本养老保险详解\">基本养老保险详解</h2><p>基本养老保险是所有职工必须参加的社会保险，也是退休收入的基础保障层。理解基本养老金的计算方法，有助于评估你未来的退休收入缺口。</p>\n<p><strong>养老金计算公式</strong>：</p>\n<p>月基本养老金 = 基础养老金 + 个人账户养老金</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PensionCalculation {&#10;  retirementAge: number;&#10;  startWorkAge: number;&#10;  avgLocalSalary: number;&#10;  avgIndexedSalary: number;&#10;  personalAccountBalance: number;&#10;  paymentYears: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function calculateBasicPension(calc: PensionCalculation): {&#10;  basicPension: number;&#10;  personalAccountPension: number;&#10;  totalMonthlyPension: number;&#10;  replacementRate: number;&#10;} {&#10;  const monthsMap: Record&lt;number, number&gt; = {&#10;    50: 195,&#10;    55: 170,&#10;    60: 139,&#10;    65: 101,&#10;  };&#10;  const accountMonths = monthsMap[calc.retirementAge] ?? 139;&#10;&#10;  const basicPension = (((calc.avgLocalSalary + calc.avgIndexedSalary) / 2) * calc.paymentYears) / 100;&#10;&#10;  const personalAccountPension = calc.personalAccountBalance / accountMonths;&#10;&#10;  const totalMonthlyPension = basicPension + personalAccountPension;&#10;  const replacementRate = totalMonthlyPension / calc.avgIndexedSalary;&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    basicPension: Math.round(basicPension),&#10;    personalAccountPension: Math.round(personalAccountPension),&#10;    totalMonthlyPension: Math.round(totalMonthlyPension),&#10;    replacementRate,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PensionCalculation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retirementAge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  startWorkAge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  avgLocalSalary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  avgIndexedSalary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  personalAccountBalance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  paymentYears</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateBasicPension</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">calc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PensionCalculation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  basicPension</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  personalAccountPension</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalMonthlyPension</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  replacementRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> monthsMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">195</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    55</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">170</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">139</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    65</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">101</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> accountMonths</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> monthsMap[calc.retirementAge] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 139</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> basicPension</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (((calc.avgLocalSalary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> calc.avgIndexedSalary) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> calc.paymentYears) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> personalAccountPension</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> calc.personalAccountBalance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accountMonths;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> totalMonthlyPension</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> basicPension </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> personalAccountPension;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> replacementRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalMonthlyPension </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> calc.avgIndexedSalary;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    basicPension: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(basicPension),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    personalAccountPension: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(personalAccountPension),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    totalMonthlyPension: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(totalMonthlyPension),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    replacementRate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>以一线城市程序员为例的估算：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景参数</th>\n<th>数值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>当前月薪</td>\n<td>30,000 元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缴费基数(封顶)</td>\n<td>~33,000 元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个人缴费比例</td>\n<td>8%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预计缴费年限</td>\n<td>30 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预计退休年龄</td>\n<td>65 岁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当地社平工资(退休时)</td>\n<td>~25,000 元(估)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>估算退休后月养老金约 8,000-12,000 元，替代率约 30-40%。这意味着如果你退休前月入 3 万，基本养老金只能覆盖三分之一左右的生活费用。缺口需要通过其他渠道弥补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"个人养老金制度\">个人养老金制度</h2><p>2022 年 11 月正式实施的个人养老金制度是第三支柱的核心。对于边际税率较高的程序员来说，这是一个不应错过的税优投资渠道。</p>\n<p><strong>个人养老金的核心机制</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[开设个人养老金账户] --&gt; B[每年缴费 ≤12000元]&#10;    B --&gt; C[缴费金额税前扣除]&#10;    C --&gt; D[选择投资产品]&#10;    D --&gt; E[投资收益暂不征税]&#10;    E --&gt; F{达到领取条件}&#10;    F --&gt; G[按3%税率单独征税]\">flowchart LR\n    A[开设个人养老金账户] --&gt; B[每年缴费 ≤12000元]\n    B --&gt; C[缴费金额税前扣除]\n    C --&gt; D[选择投资产品]\n    D --&gt; E[投资收益暂不征税]\n    E --&gt; F{达到领取条件}\n    F --&gt; G[按3%税率单独征税]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>具体内容</th>\n<th>对程序员的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>年缴费上限</td>\n<td>12,000 元</td>\n<td>约 1000 元/月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税前扣除</td>\n<td>缴费从应纳税所得额中扣除</td>\n<td>边际税率20%时，年节税2400元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资产品</td>\n<td>养老目标基金、养老理财、养老储蓄、养老保险</td>\n<td>选择范围有限但在扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领取条件</td>\n<td>退休/完全丧失劳动能力/出国定居</td>\n<td>流动性差，长期锁定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领取税率</td>\n<td>3% 单独计税</td>\n<td>远低于缴费时的边际税率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>继承</td>\n<td>可继承</td>\n<td>不用担心&quot;缴了拿不到&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>不同边际税率下的节税效果</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>当前边际税率</th>\n<th>年缴费</th>\n<th>年节税</th>\n<th>领取时税率</th>\n<th>净节税率</th>\n<th>30年累计节税(不考虑时间价值)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>12,000</td>\n<td>1,200</td>\n<td>3%</td>\n<td>7%</td>\n<td>36,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>12,000</td>\n<td>2,400</td>\n<td>3%</td>\n<td>17%</td>\n<td>72,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>12,000</td>\n<td>3,000</td>\n<td>3%</td>\n<td>22%</td>\n<td>90,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>12,000</td>\n<td>3,600</td>\n<td>3%</td>\n<td>27%</td>\n<td>108,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>35%</td>\n<td>12,000</td>\n<td>4,200</td>\n<td>3%</td>\n<td>32%</td>\n<td>126,000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键决策点</strong>：如果你的边际税率≥10%，开通个人养老金账户就是划算的（因为领取时只按3%征税）。边际税率越高越划算。对于大多数处于20%-25%税率档的程序员，年节税2400-3000元。</p>\n<p>注意事项：个人养老金账户的资金在退休前基本不能取出（流动性极差），因此不要因为追求节税而影响日常资金安排。建议在满足应急基金和日常投资后，再将结余资金投入个人养老金。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退休收入缺口分析\">退休收入缺口分析</h2><p>退休规划的核心问题是：你退休后每月需要多少钱，以及现有的养老保障能覆盖多少？</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RetirementGapAnalysis {&#10;  currentAge: number;&#10;  targetRetirementAge: number;&#10;  currentMonthlyExpense: number;&#10;  inflationRate: number;&#10;  basicPensionEstimate: number;&#10;  annuityEstimate: number;&#10;  personalPensionEstimate: number;&#10;  lifeExpectancy: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function analyzeRetirementGap(analysis: RetirementGapAnalysis): {&#10;  retirementMonthlyExpense: number;&#10;  totalPensionIncome: number;&#10;  monthlyGap: number;&#10;  totalGap: number;&#10;  requiredSavings: number;&#10;} {&#10;  const yearsToRetirement = analysis.targetRetirementAge - analysis.currentAge;&#10;  const retirementYears = analysis.lifeExpectancy - analysis.targetRetirementAge;&#10;&#10;  const retirementMonthlyExpense =&#10;    analysis.currentMonthlyExpense * Math.pow(1 + analysis.inflationRate, yearsToRetirement);&#10;&#10;  const totalPensionIncome =&#10;    analysis.basicPensionEstimate + analysis.annuityEstimate + analysis.personalPensionEstimate;&#10;&#10;  const monthlyGap = retirementMonthlyExpense - totalPensionIncome;&#10;  const totalGap = monthlyGap * 12 * retirementYears;&#10;&#10;  const requiredSavings = totalGap / Math.pow(1 + 0.03, retirementYears / 2);&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    retirementMonthlyExpense: Math.round(retirementMonthlyExpense),&#10;    totalPensionIncome: Math.round(totalPensionIncome),&#10;    monthlyGap: Math.round(monthlyGap),&#10;    totalGap: Math.round(totalGap),&#10;    requiredSavings: Math.round(requiredSavings),&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RetirementGapAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currentAge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetRetirementAge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currentMonthlyExpense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  inflationRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  basicPensionEstimate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  annuityEstimate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  personalPensionEstimate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lifeExpectancy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyzeRetirementGap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">analysis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RetirementGapAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retirementMonthlyExpense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalPensionIncome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  monthlyGap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalGap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requiredSavings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> yearsToRetirement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analysis.targetRetirementAge </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analysis.currentAge;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> retirementYears</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analysis.lifeExpectancy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analysis.targetRetirementAge;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> retirementMonthlyExpense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    analysis.currentMonthlyExpense </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analysis.inflationRate, yearsToRetirement);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> totalPensionIncome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    analysis.basicPensionEstimate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analysis.annuityEstimate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analysis.personalPensionEstimate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> monthlyGap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retirementMonthlyExpense </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalPensionIncome;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> totalGap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> monthlyGap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retirementYears;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> requiredSavings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalGap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.03</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, retirementYears </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retirementMonthlyExpense: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(retirementMonthlyExpense),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    totalPensionIncome: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(totalPensionIncome),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    monthlyGap: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(monthlyGap),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    totalGap: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(totalGap),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    requiredSavings: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(requiredSavings),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>典型程序员退休缺口估算</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>假设参数</th>\n<th>保守估计</th>\n<th>中等估计</th>\n<th>乐观估计</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>退休月支出(今天价值)</td>\n<td>10,000</td>\n<td>15,000</td>\n<td>20,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通胀率</td>\n<td>3%</td>\n<td>3%</td>\n<td>3%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30年后退休月支出</td>\n<td>24,273</td>\n<td>36,409</td>\n<td>48,545</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基本养老金(估)</td>\n<td>10,000</td>\n<td>10,000</td>\n<td>10,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月缺口</td>\n<td>14,273</td>\n<td>26,409</td>\n<td>38,545</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25年退休期总缺口</td>\n<td>428万</td>\n<td>792万</td>\n<td>1,156万</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>即使是保守估计，退休资金缺口也在 400 万以上。这个数字说明了<strong>仅靠基本养老金远远不够</strong>，个人投资和储蓄必须在工作期间就开始系统化积累。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((养老金账户体系))&#10;    三支柱&#10;      第一支柱: 基本养老金&#10;      第二支柱: 企业年金&#10;      第三支柱: 个人养老金&#10;    基本养老金&#10;      替代率仅 30-40%&#10;      强制缴纳&#10;      远不够维持生活&#10;    个人养老金&#10;      年缴上限 12000元&#10;      边际税率20%+必开&#10;      年节税 2400+元&#10;    退休缺口&#10;      保守估计 400万+&#10;      必须个人投资补足&#10;      越早开始越好\">mindmap\n  root((养老金账户体系))\n    三支柱\n      第一支柱: 基本养老金\n      第二支柱: 企业年金\n      第三支柱: 个人养老金\n    基本养老金\n      替代率仅 30-40%\n      强制缴纳\n      远不够维持生活\n    个人养老金\n      年缴上限 12000元\n      边际税率20%+必开\n      年节税 2400+元\n    退休缺口\n      保守估计 400万+\n      必须个人投资补足\n      越早开始越好</pre><ul>\n<li>中国养老保障三支柱中，基本养老金替代率仅 30-40%，程序员需自行补足缺口</li>\n<li>大部分互联网公司不提供企业年金，退休规划主要靠个人投资</li>\n<li>个人养老金账户对边际税率≥10% 的程序员均划算，年节税 1200-4200 元</li>\n<li>典型程序员的退休资金缺口保守估计在 400 万以上，需要工作期间系统积累</li>\n<li>个人养老金流动性差，应在满足应急基金和日常投资后再参与</li>\n<li>退休规划越早开始越好，复利效应在长期投资中发挥决定性作用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"养老金账户体系","id":"养老金账户体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本养老保险详解","id":"基本养老保险详解"},{"level":2,"text":"个人养老金制度","id":"个人养老金制度"},{"level":2,"text":"退休收入缺口分析","id":"退休收入缺口分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"复利效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/personal-finance/retirement-planning/compound-interest"},"next":{"title":"资产配置策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/personal-finance/retirement-planning/asset-allocation"}}